      <p begin="00:03.632" end="00:05.612" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:05.612" end="00:08.445" ttm:agent="v1">Been too long, been too many cities</p>
      <p begin="00:08.445" end="00:11.885" ttm:agent="v1">Been too— haha, ayy, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:11.885" end="00:14.503" ttm:agent="v1">Been too long, been too many cities</p>
      <p begin="00:14.503" end="00:17.543" ttm:agent="v1">Loverboy at heart, but still hard on the ho</p>
      <p begin="00:17.543" end="00:20.296" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a purple-hearted ski, four thousand a coat</p>
      <p begin="00:20.296" end="00:21.796" ttm:agent="v1">You can get it like me, if you patient, you close</p>
