      <p begin="00:23.403" end="00:26.364" ttm:agent="v1">If she pretty, I'll do it, but we takin' it slow</p>
      <p begin="00:26.364" end="00:29.276" ttm:agent="v1">I got locked in with the jewelers, used to steal from the store</p>
