      <p begin="00:35.396" end="00:38.325" ttm:agent="v1">You got rich in Night City, say you ain't comin' back</p>
      <p begin="00:38.325" end="00:41.383" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, racks, on racks, on racks, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:41.383" end="00:44.632" ttm:agent="v1">Racks, on racks, on racks, wake up with a Barbie</p>
      <p begin="00:44.632" end="00:47.729" ttm:agent="v1">Say it like you mean it, but it was never for me</p>
      <p begin="00:47.729" end="00:50.607" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta see it to believe it, I'm a visionary probably</p>
      <p begin="00:50.607" end="00:53.507" ttm:agent="v1">Niggas finished, that's a wrap, you know that's a different story</p>
      <p begin="00:53.507" end="00:55.007" ttm:agent="v1">Racks, on racks, on racks, ayy</p>
